Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby. Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,右额叶区有枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunshot wound to the right frontal area.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有发现出口伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No exit wound found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  辛格先生  你的时辰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. Singer. Your time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.11,0:00:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.57,0:00:26.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是走是留  你怎么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be? Stay or go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:34.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还杀了我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:35.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死艾米可没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Amy was not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你下不了手  所以我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't do it, so I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道做这些事为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I'm doing much of anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不请自说地给你个建议  放弃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my advice you didn't ask for -- quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会抛下我弟弟不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna walk out on my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.22,0:00:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就像我一样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强迫自己直到周末都要打起精神来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decide to be fine until the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要活着就要保持微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself smile because you're alive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:00:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一周继续如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do it again the next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:01:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么面带微笑  好好干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it right... with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么直接退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芭比  是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barb, that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第13集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:12.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是鲍比的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that Bobby's?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你还留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you kept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己的裂了个缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, mine sprung a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一般人会拿张...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, most people would just carry a --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照片什么的做留念\N{\fnArial\fs30}a photo or something for a memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧你  我这是在向鲍比致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, man. I'm -- I'm honoring the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂不\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算是种疗伤法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, uh, grief therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是也在借白费劲的任务疗伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like you and your wild-goose chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-白费劲  -对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wild-goose chase? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两周内有四个人被谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four guys murdered in two weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双手双脚被砍\N{\fnArial\fs30}hands and feet cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是某个恋脚癖发癫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, some guy with a foot fetish run amuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成年男性被重重掷到墙上  甚至穿墙而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grown men thrown so hard they went through walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道没看那条新闻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you -- did you even read the article?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  我当时在打盹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was napping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先不说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有什么别的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else you got going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时查不了迪克·罗曼了  我们最好...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Roman's a dead end for now. We might as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-忙起来  -忙起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay busy. - Stay busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.01,0:03:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.29,0:03:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位死者可能不会是最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The latest but probably not the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩总是忙到这么晚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys always work this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.55,0:04:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加班烦死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Hours suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过福利很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but great benefits package.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-药费报销10%  -真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 10% co-pay on all drugs. - Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.11,0:04:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也就是普通的非专利药吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but just generic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  名牌药也行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, name brands are cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没错  -那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - So...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:21.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位老兄体重多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's our boy here weigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,90公斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}A buck 90.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被重重掷到墙上  身体都变形了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrown against a wall so hard it buckled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从犯罪现场的血流量来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on the blood flow at the crime scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手脚在死者还一息尚存时就被砍下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hands and feet were cut off while he was still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和其他死者一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:31.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶手想折磨他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer wanted him to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有死者都是男性  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the vics were male, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上都刻着和这个相同的图案\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the, uh, same kind of artwork as this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几个案发现场留有凶手的DNA吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, DNA left at any of the scenes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前一个案子的死者咬伤了凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}One before this, the guy bit the attacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸体送过来的时候  牙里还塞了一块肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still had a chunk of flesh in his teeth when he came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直是送上门来的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about as good as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-找到匹配了吗  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, we have a match? - We do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,样本被拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samples were rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没找到任何与之匹配的基因标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The genetic markers don't match anything we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和数据库里的人都不匹配吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't match any person in the database?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我的意思是这不是人类的样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, they don't match anything human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得承认  这可能是跟我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll admit, it could be in the general vicinity
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做的活儿有那么点沾边\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the ballpark of our kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  一听说"不是人类的样本"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, "Didn't match anything human"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:08.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就基本没跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}usually seals the deal for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前从没见过这个符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I've never seen this symbol before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们先去吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a bite to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后回旅馆上网查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}go back to the motel, haul out the laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个主意太赞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, that's a brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个别的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你照自己说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去卧底  混进当地人群里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go undercover, go mingle amongst the locals,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看能查出什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see what kind of clues bubble to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:30.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简而言之就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to oversimplify it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(深蓝酒吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚餐加电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner and a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听上是去不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which sounded fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但看的却是《人体蜈蚣》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the movie was "Human Centipede."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:48.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你不喜欢看那种片子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so, wait. Uh, so you had a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我最差劲的一次约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The date from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约会什么的最没谱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dating, right? Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但貌似也没别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what's the option?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没打算这么快就安定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see settling down anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很少听到有人这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's something you don't hear every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:04.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好走进爱情坟墓了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready for the big commit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:14.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西服很帅气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice suit, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多男人都不懂得打扮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys don't dress up much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.87,0:06:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我工作上的着装要求比较保守罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it's, uh, a conservative line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}What line is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,投资银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Investment banking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-老天啊  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, god. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说经常加班加点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the hours are ridic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过来钱很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's money to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去年挣得还不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a fortunate year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你财源滚滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}...may you have many more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arigatou.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还会说日语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮毛而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, enough to get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你真有两下子  -谁说不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at you. - Yeah, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.83,0:07:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想换个地方接着聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to move this conversation elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你脸色真差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉上更差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I feel worse than I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我真心推荐深蓝酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do recommend the Cobalt Room, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚玩得很嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我这把年纪有点玩不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I think I'm getting too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你研究出那个符号的含义了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you, uh, figure out that symbol?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  咱们得找专家帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Um, we're gonna need an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专家  咱们的专家死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expert? Our expert's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:56.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从墙上摔到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comes off the wall down here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布置得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nice decor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是早期的屠宰场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very early slaughterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局来人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.45,0:09:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二位  这位是夏琳·佩恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, this is Charlene Penn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是本案的负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the lead on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,案情和之前相似  没有强行闯入迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of the same. Uh, no forced entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:11.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者在屋内遭到抛掷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrown across the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶手就是要折磨死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双手双脚都被砍掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both hands and feet cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:18.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胸口有同样的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same symbol in the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是谁干的  这家伙真是个禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Whoever the killer is, the guy's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:22.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这人和上一个很相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's just like the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,30出头  长相英俊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eerly 30s, decent looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  和之前三个也差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Just like the first three, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事业有成  并没有什么敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairly successful, no known enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来处理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:43.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想弄清楚这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to find out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry was a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚杰瑞被谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry was killed sometime last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你住附近吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you live nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  隔了两间屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Two doors down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道会有人想伤害杰瑞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, you know anyone who would want to harm Jerry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  他可是个大好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He was the nicest guy in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他妻子和他关系挺紧张的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his -- his wife wasn't real happy with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几天前  他有过一夜情\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few nights ago, he has a little one-night fling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安发现了  之后离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ann found out, took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.99,0:10:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她绝不会做出这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...she would never do anything like...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说死者的妻子发现他出轨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said the vic's wife caught him cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.89,0:10:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是总不会是他妻子干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we're not thinking it's the wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非她能举起350磅的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless she benches 350
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且杀掉其他那几个人作为热身\N{\fnArial\fs30}and did the other guys as a warm-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.97,0:10:30.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把鲍比的酒瓶落在莉迪亚那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left Bobby's flask over at Lydia's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉迪亚是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lydia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚的锻炼搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}My workout partner from last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我得过去取一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've got to go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你不但知道她的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, not only do you know her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要打电话给她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're actually gonna call her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  她把电话给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet -- she gave you her number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:46.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们都会给你留电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always give you their number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉迪亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lydia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我  昨晚的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's, uh, Dean from last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我好想落了点东西在你那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, listen, I think I left something over at your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个旧的酒瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an old flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来可能不起眼  但它有些纪念意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't look like much, but it has sentimental value.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我看见了  我会打给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I do, I'll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:14.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要我的电话号码吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want my number?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我手机会自动存下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cell grabbed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:17.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.89,0:11:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得先挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会儿有点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just real busy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她真的很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's real busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制住  莉迪亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, Lydia,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的事情都应该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}as in all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}One final push.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这疼痛是一种荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pain is an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给她起个什么名字呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will we call her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.55,0:12:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就叫她艾玛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll call her Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(人类学系)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  这符号画得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And actually, rather accomplished draftsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  如果不去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if you get past the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是刻在人身上的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was carved into a guy's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.09,0:12:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫瑞森教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Morrison,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你能告诉我们这符号什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're hoping you can tell us what the symbol means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  也许能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很有可能可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible I could, even likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局有什么报酬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the FBI offering suitable remuneration?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国家会为此感激  尊敬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The respect of a grateful nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还会在国税局那儿给你说好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a good word with the I.R.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这看起来很古老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it appears quite ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,缩小些范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that narrows it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:14.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个和崇拜相关的符号被讹传的版本\N{\fnArial\fs30}A corrupted version of symbology associated with worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是哪个地区的含糊的手绘版本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely an obscure regional script.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:19.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这得研究些时日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this will require some research.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们明天再来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, I guess we'll be seeing you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:24.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.65,0:13:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经放弃假期研究这样的项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've spent entire sabbaticals on a project like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在追查一个连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a serial killer on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的政府需要你  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your government needs you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:41.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的管家需要一张绿卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}my housekeeper needs a green card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.86,0:13:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你在哪找到的这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good god, where'd you find this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是这领域最权威的专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's supposed to be a top expert in his field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但如果他研究领域的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, when his field includes things
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:52.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会在夜里捣鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}that go bump in the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他最好值得咱们刚才浪费的口舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna be worth the breath we just wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那咱们应该怎么办呢  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we supposed to do, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浪费时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spin our wheels?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.51,0:14:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  这就是浪费时间  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this is us spinning our wheels, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:02.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我也想找他  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you know what? I want to call him, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但鲍比不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Bobby's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:06.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们只能将就了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're settling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sure are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:12.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  她怎么还不打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, why hasn't she called?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.28,0:14:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁  莉迪亚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? Lydia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  难道这次是你被一个姑娘给玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so some girl's actually dumping you the morning after?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你的幸灾乐祸有点过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're enjoying this a little more than you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管她了  我过去取那酒瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw it. I'm going over there and getting the flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.41,0:14:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你是没收到我的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you didn't get my messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我收到了  我一直很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I did. I've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚我把我的酒瓶落在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I, uh, left that flask over here the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它真的很旧很烂  我差点扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so beat up and old, I almost tossed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  它的主人也是一个德行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, guy it belonged to was beat up and old, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我和他关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was very close with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想丢了他的酒瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd, uh, I'd hate to lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:14:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了很忙以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than "Busy."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很忙  给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really busy. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能看出来你很忙  你在帮人照看孩子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see why you're busy. You've been babysitting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是你的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.59,0:15:19.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没告诉我你还有个小女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell me you had a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们大概还有很多没对彼此坦白的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's probably all kinds of things we didn't tell each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  艾玛  这是你的第一个孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Emma. Your first?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说她们这年龄长得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hear they grow like weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.59,0:15:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本想象不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我得接这电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I got to take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Hey. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个酒瓶啊  又不是圣杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a flask, not the holy grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我这人喜欢与人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, I'm a people person, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正忙着交际呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm engaging in some social skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫瑞森给你回话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get anything out of Morrison?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有  你能回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not yet. Look, would you get back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.07,0:15:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罪证化验室那边让咱们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're due at the crime lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.09,0:16:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, why don't you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那间屋里的人是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that guy in the other room?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别出声  等下再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk. We'll discuss it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等下打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死者依然是体重不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, again, we got a guy weighing about two bills...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却被猛力扔到墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrown into a wall so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以致颅骨中都插入几片石膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's got pieces of plaster lodged in his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联邦探员为什么也来掺和这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What triggered the feds' involvement in this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:38.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总以为你们另有要事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always think you boys have bigger fish to fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样  实际上  我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Actually, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是因为跟之前几桩悬案很相似吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just figured it was the similarity to the other cold cases?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.85,0:16:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是同一凶手所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's the same killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他必然跨越了州界线  所以你们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he crossed state lines -- that would bring you guys in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如他所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  随你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得搞定这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to wrap this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们手里的案子不止你这件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your case isn't the only one we're working on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,习惯就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get used to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾迪  对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so, Eddie, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没带那些悬案的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't bring the cold-case files with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.10,0:17:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有副本吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a chance you have a copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当然  -好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深蓝酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cobalt Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  它名气很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's pretty well known.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要找艳遇的话  那地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking to hook up, it's a pretty good place to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二号死者也去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vic Number Two was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据保安人员说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And according to his security guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟一个漂亮姑娘走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he left with a hot girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两天后  他就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days later, he's an obituary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:36.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和杰瑞·普莱斯情况一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same with Jerry Price.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  而且就我们看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. And, uh, as far as we can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有多起相似案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least a couple of those in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与芝加哥的案件如出一辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  多数死者婚姻破裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. A lot of busted marriages,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.01,0:17:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是跟陌生女人有一夜情  如此之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}flings with unknown women, that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是在他们死前\N{\fnArial\fs30}All just before they got offed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.52,0:18:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Emma ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喂  -伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在莉迪亚家外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm outside Lydia's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:32.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  老兄  你怎么  你迷上她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, man. What, are you obsessed or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我下午目睹了好多怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been eating at the buffet of strange all afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:37.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我弄清楚就告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you the second I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不大对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是你迷上她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你需要后援还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, you need backup or...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  还不用  你那边情况怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not yet. What's up on your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来  同样的连环谋杀以前也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, there was an identical murder fest
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.37,0:18:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两年前在芝加哥  再两年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}two years years ago in Chicago, and again in Miami
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈阿密也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}two years before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有死者都是年轻的成功人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the victims were young, successful,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,许多人去过同一间酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot of them went to the same bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好几起案子  总是很快就断了线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}It lines up. The trails always went cold fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -是的  顺便提下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah. Oh, and by the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得私下提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a personal kicker,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这边  至少部分死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}here, at least some of the vics
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在你去的酒吧泡过女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}hooked up in that bar you went to,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.87,0:19:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  那间"深蓝酒吧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, The Cobalt Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  伙计  你躲过一劫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, just saying, man, you, you dodged the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.01,0:19:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聊天愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emma, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:22.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来  艾玛  要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Emma. Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.51,0:19:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做个好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make us proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will, mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真讨厌这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate when this happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许她还有一个孩子  只是没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, so maybe she has another kid she didn't tell you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会  就这一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, just the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那晚我和她在一起时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that night, when I was with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还没有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}she didn't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去过她家  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was at her place, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里没有游戏围栏  毯子或者橡皮鸭\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no playpens, no blankets, no rubber ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.03,0:20:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  说得好像你真能观察那么细\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Like you would have been focused on that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  这是你观察到的第一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dude, that's the first thing you notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.15,0:20:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是危险警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red flags.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.27,0:20:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  突然之间  嘭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, all of a sudden, boom --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你看到说话的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the one you thought talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.09,0:20:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的确说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:20:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是婴儿嘟嘟囔囔那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not baby talk, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:03.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候这么了解儿童发育了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know so much about child development?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:04.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我知道他们不该会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know enough to know that they don't say,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"妈妈  那个家伙是谁"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, mom. Who's that guy?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:08.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,言归正传\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, cut to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉迪亚把那个叫她妈妈的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lydia's handing this kid who's calling her mommy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给两个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}over to these two women, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这次不是婴儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is not a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  绝对不是  这小孩得有五岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, this kid's got to be 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字还是艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And same name -- Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔治·福尔曼(世界重量级拳击冠军)给所有儿子都命名乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, George Foreman named all his sons george.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你故意惹我是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you deliberately messing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.74,0:21:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  我知道什么事不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I know weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  这事情怎么说都不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? There is no non-weird explanation for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今早  艾玛还是个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning, Emma was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傍晚她就摇身变成汉娜·蒙塔纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}By sunset, she's Hannah Montana.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:34.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早年的她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  是教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Good. The professor. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我确信他能解开谜题  -嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sure he'll crack this wide open. - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.81,0:21:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个特殊晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this special night,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们将加入一个特别的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}you join an exceptional family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们已准备好在我们中取得一席之位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ready to take your places alongside us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并学习我们的传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}and learn our traditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是向我们的创造者也是保护者致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a tribute to the one who created and protects us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.53,0:21:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为她狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hunt for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为她杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们将猎物吃下  以表示我们的团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we consume that kill as a symbol of unity,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与那些已经完成了他们血的使命的人融为一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}with those who have completed their blood missions,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.71,0:22:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也延续我们部落的血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and furthered the life of the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.60,0:22:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃啊  艾玛  你要吃了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Emma. You need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.03,0:22:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  辨认出这个符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, identifying this scroll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:33.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是轻松的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}was no day at the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次级的学者只能抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lesser scholars would have crumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:37.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教授  能讲讲符号吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor... the symbol?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.31,0:22:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.69,0:22:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它很古老  地域性强\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ancient, regional.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:43.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常难鉴别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very difficult to identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我终于找到了匹配的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I managed to find a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是一个符号的变形\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a variation of a symbol
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与希腊万神殿有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}associated with the Greek Pantheon,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是女神哈耳摩尼亚(和谐与协调女神)的神庙\N{\fnArial\fs30}the temple of the Goddess Harmonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.58,0:22:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据神话\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to myth,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.46,0:22:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈耳摩尼亚与战神阿瑞斯结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}the coupling of Harmonia and Ares, the god of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.25,0:22:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,创造了亚马逊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}produced the Amazons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.61,0:22:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚马逊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Amazons?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.01,0:22:57.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是神奇女侠那种吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Wonder Woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.97,0:23:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是一个战士组成的部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, like -- like a tribe of warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.07,0:23:01.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们真实存在过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They actually existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.51,0:23:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漫画都是些愚蠢的曲解\N{\fnArial\fs30}The comic books -- they're just silly perversions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.65,0:23:07.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为这个符号起源于亚马逊人的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The symbol -- I believe it originated with the Amazons,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.25,0:23:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是用来向哈耳摩尼亚致敬的象形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}pictographs meant to pay homage to Harmonia --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以叫它神秘附身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}occult talismans, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.69,0:23:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们格外崇尚女性文化\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had an exclusively female culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.46,0:23:17.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男性完全是没用的  除了繁衍后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}No use for men whatsoever, except procreation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.86,0:23:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有死者都是男性\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the vics were male.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你说的  这个符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you said -- with this symbol
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被刻在他们胸前\N{\fnArial\fs30}carved in their chests.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手脚都被砍掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their hands and feet cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.79,0:23:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  亮点就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.64,0:23:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引起了我们的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got our attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.61,0:23:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们怀孕后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After they were impregnated,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会杀了男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they killed the male --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.55,0:23:30.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但先要砍掉特定的身体部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}First cutting off certain body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.97,0:23:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没法查到他们的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't check their I.Ds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们所有文件都是伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because everything they have is fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我查了好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been digging for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.17,0:23:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一点是确定的  他们不是联邦调查局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one thing's for sure -- they ain't FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.47,0:23:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.45,0:23:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是来追查我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're after us, is what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.22,0:23:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得之前穿越全国的大屠杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that cross-country murder spree?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.05,0:23:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.05,0:23:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个月前那对疯狂的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those crazy brothers went on a couple months ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.33,0:23:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是他们吗  -还只是冰山一角\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's them? - Barely scratches the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.95,0:23:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是暴徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.55,0:23:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侠士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vigilantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.86,0:23:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  听着  我们以前也和这样的猎人交过手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, look, we've dealt with hunters like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.41,0:24:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样嘛...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.85,0:24:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个已经计划好要除掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one is already scheduled to be taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再把另一个也安排在日程上就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just simply add the other one to the agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道鲍比有本专讲希腊怪事的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Bobby's got a Grecian encyclopedia of weird in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.46,0:24:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还看见过呢  就是翻这堆该死的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it last time I was looking through this stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按序摆放会要他命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it kill him to have a system?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a system.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.95,0:24:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的资料像他的大脑一样井然有序\N{\fnArial\fs30}His files are set up like his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.69,0:24:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.78,0:24:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.91,0:24:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一堆关于亚马逊人的疯狂传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this whole crazy side to Amazon lore
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.02,0:24:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个莫瑞森教授没提到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that professor Morrison didn't even mention.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为他不相信那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 'cause he doesn't believe in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.21,0:24:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们想要对付他们  他的态度就很碍事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is a real handicap when you're trying to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.51,0:24:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.13,0:24:40.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来曾经发生过漫长而血腥的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, apparently, there was this long, bloody war.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.06,0:24:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚马逊人口骤减\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Amazon population was decimated,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.88,0:24:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们和哈耳摩尼亚达成协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they made a bargain with Harmonia
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.63,0:24:46.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,增加人口数目和增强人口体格\N{\fnArial\fs30}to replenish their ranks and make them stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.93,0:24:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说能把成年男人扔穿墙  体格是大大增强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd say throwing grown men through walls was stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.13,0:24:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  总的来说他们比人类强壮多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, basically, they became more than human.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.72,0:24:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈耳摩尼亚把他们都变成怪物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harmonia turned them into monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.65,0:24:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们能和人一样被杀死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you kill them like humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.69,0:24:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是需要什么技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is there some kind of trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.96,0:24:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh doesn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  我想大概都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea. I guess it could go either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.36,0:25:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有用  还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's helpful. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.15,0:25:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说是他们繁殖非常快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lore says they reproduced quickly --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.29,0:25:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到  男女结合后36小时她们就能生产\N{\fnArial\fs30}as in, after mating, they gave birth within 36 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.56,0:25:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子生长也异常快速\N{\fnArial\fs30}The babies grew incredibly fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.29,0:25:18.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后生长速度就会变得正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the aging process became normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.16,0:25:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想  这也是组建军队的一种办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is one way to make an army, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.30,0:25:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结合周期大约是两年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mating cycle is every two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.38,0:25:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会把所有达到生育年龄的妇女派出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They send out all the women who have reached child-bearing age.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.72,0:25:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就说得通了  因为每两年才会换个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which lines up, 'cause this happens every couple of years
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生一次  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in different towns, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.70,0:25:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.05,0:25:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明确知道至少有数名死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we know for sure that at least some of the vics
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.11,0:25:36.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经和陌生女子在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}hooked up with strange women
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.22,0:25:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后就被以亚马逊人的方式杀掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}days before being killed Amazon style.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.34,0:25:43.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在我泡到莉迪亚的酒吧把到妹子的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hooked up in the same bar I met Lydia, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.22,0:25:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -然后突然之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Yeah. - And then suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.49,0:25:49.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就迅速有了个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's got a little baby in like fruit-fly time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.05,0:25:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小宝宝很快变成了小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That baby turns into a little girl just as fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.77,0:25:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-所以也许你是  -别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So maybe you're -- - Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.74,0:26:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  如果那孩子是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if that kid's yours --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.71,0:26:01.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.87,0:26:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不说了  但是  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I won't. But, Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.21,0:26:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  说真的  一夜情  你就打算...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, seriously, a one-night stand, you're just gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.45,0:26:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-碰运气吗  你连那个都...  -当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- roll the dice? You don't even -- - Of course not...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.06,0:26:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.11,0:26:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我傻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you think I'm brain-dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.20,0:26:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是有意外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accidents happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.47,0:26:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是发生了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one even did,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.68,0:26:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我觉得不是这样的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I-I-I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.38,0:26:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你知道吗  不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You know what? Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.79,0:26:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不要再说这件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna talk about this anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.94,0:26:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都起鸡皮疙瘩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because my skin's starting to crawl!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.67,0:26:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.76,0:26:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果是真的  如果发生了这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's true, if it happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.15,0:26:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我得小心我的手和脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I got to hang on to my hands and feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.75,0:26:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的进步让我们十分欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so pleased with your progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.37,0:26:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在汲取我们先母的传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are absorbing the traditions of our mothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.27,0:26:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们即将完成你们的部落使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are close to fulfilling your tribal destiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.19,0:26:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你们的姐妹并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}and taking your place alongse your sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.74,0:26:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天  你们成为战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, you are a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.43,0:26:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们虽与他人同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though you may walk among others,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.73,0:27:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却要心属部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}your heart is only with the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.38,0:27:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快  你们就要迈出最终的光荣的一步长大成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, you will take the final, glorious step into adulthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.13,0:27:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天你们要学会如何忍受痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, you will learn how to endure pain
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.05,0:27:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及如何给他人痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how to inflict it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.25,0:27:12.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顶住  艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight it, Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.17,0:27:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡事皆须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As with all you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勇气是你的全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}courage is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.74,0:27:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看鲍比的资料真是垃圾里捞针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking through Bobby's files is like dumpster diving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.19,0:27:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.36,0:27:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚马逊人想找\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it makes sense why the Amazons
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.39,0:27:34.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高帅富结合也说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}all want to hook up with decent-looking, successful guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.16,0:27:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传宗接代还挑三拣四吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're picky about the gene pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.81,0:27:37.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.63,0:27:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... 
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:42.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉迪亚干嘛选了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was Lydia doing with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.58,0:27:46.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可能或许以为我是富有的投资银行家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she may or may not have thought I was a rich investment banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.54,0:27:56.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.89,0:27:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.56,0:27:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几张纸动地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These papers just moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-啥  -我可没动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I didn't touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.89,0:28:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.16,0:28:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redline.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.38,0:28:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redline.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.95,0:28:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.96,0:28:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电力线就在敞开的窗子旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}power lines by the open window,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.29,0:28:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚好有阵小风\N{\fnArial\fs30}where there's a breeze...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.50,0:28:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可能吹动了纸  -你感到小风了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That could have moved the papers. - Did you feel a breeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.32,0:28:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也没什么关系了  迪恩  读数是无效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter, Dean. The readings are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.63,0:28:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.83,0:28:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他火葬了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We burned him, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.06,0:28:54.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那又如何  -你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what? - So, what are you suggesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.77,0:28:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.54,0:28:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专心干别的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate on something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.15,0:29:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -因为那不是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Because it's not Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.57,0:29:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有可能啊  -不  不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could be. - No, it couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.91,0:29:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -因为那是我们一厢情愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Because we want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.06,0:29:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许会有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.78,0:29:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一堆的东西都"或许有用"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in a pile of "Maybe it's useful."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.17,0:29:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说  这是希腊文  没人会读希腊文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, it's in Greek. Nobody reads greek.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.87,0:29:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  除了希腊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except Greeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.26,0:29:19.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.13,0:29:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有莫瑞森教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}And professor Morrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.27,0:29:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.06,0:29:25.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找他  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.94,0:29:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在这儿  锁好门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here, keep the door locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.49,0:29:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪都别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.71,0:29:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不开玩笑  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean it. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.72,0:29:47.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you have got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.65,0:29:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明天有办公时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have office hours tomorrow --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.76,0:29:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  教授  我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, professor. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.83,0:29:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局给我的酬劳不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI isn't paying me enough for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.21,0:29:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我再给你点好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll sweeten the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.49,0:29:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不监听你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll remove your wiretap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.32,0:30:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不认识我  我叫艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me, but my name is Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.83,0:30:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.02,0:30:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你是我唯一能够信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're the only person I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.96,0:30:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.84,0:30:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.96,0:31:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.01,0:31:09.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一直在监视你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been watching you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.98,0:31:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从妈妈怀孕就开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever since mom got pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.98,0:31:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的被囚禁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're such a prisoner,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.93,0:31:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能告诉我你怎么跑出来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you mind telling me how you escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.05,0:31:19.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等到熄灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I waited until lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.84,0:31:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我们的女人十点过一点时换班\N{\fnArial\fs30}The women who watch over us change shifts a little after 10:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.68,0:31:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you left because...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.54,0:31:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把你安排在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stick you in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.24,0:31:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就信任他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.90,0:31:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不知道别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.52,0:31:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不去质疑他们要你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't question what they want you to do --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.27,0:31:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.73,0:31:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I had to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.12,0:31:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tortured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.71,0:31:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们告诉我说我必须忍受痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me I had to endure pain
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.30,0:31:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样才能像他们一样强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I could be strong like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想像他们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want to be like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.96,0:31:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.64,0:31:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.84,0:32:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.23,0:32:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.78,0:32:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们假设你...不像他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's assume that you're not... like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.01,0:32:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.51,0:32:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.81,0:32:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.35,0:32:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.83,0:32:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我十分怀疑她会说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seriously doubt she said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.51,0:32:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你了解我  也会十分质疑这句话的真实性\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you knew me, you would seriously doubt it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.77,0:32:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们告诉我你是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.79,0:32:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么或许你能理解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe you'll understand about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.75,0:32:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许你能保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.13,0:32:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要让我能逃离他们就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just long enough so I can get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.30,0:32:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就不来烦你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.41,0:32:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不想要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.84,0:32:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  咱们...不说那个  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's not...go there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.81,0:32:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这根本不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a matter of...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.62,0:33:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能明白这个情况很不寻常吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get this isn't a normal situation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.93,0:33:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.80,0:33:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我三天前还不存在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days ago, I wasn't even alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.48,0:33:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我现在就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.76,0:33:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈把我扔进那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother threw me into that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.54,0:33:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我爸爸...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.75,0:33:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不说了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...well...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.41,0:33:22.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是我过上一点正常生活的最后机会了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get this is my last chance to have anything normal ever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.51,0:33:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真令人着迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.44,0:33:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.89,0:33:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I haven't gotten there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.20,0:33:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这纸张是手工制作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The paper is handmade.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.49,0:33:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用纤维素  很像纸莎草纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cellulose, rather like papyrus,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.56,0:33:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以它能长时间保存\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would explain its durability.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.88,0:33:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-教授  -你是怎么拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Professor - - Wherever did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.21,0:33:40.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个天才的老疯子酒鬼给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A crazy, drunk, old genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.99,0:33:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他们总是有些好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They always have the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.02,0:33:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是用希腊文写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's in greek.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.42,0:33:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  对  这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. I-I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.68,0:33:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是什么普通的方言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a common dialect.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.89,0:33:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  你怎么就跟亚马逊人干上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, what is it with you and Amazons?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.42,0:33:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教授  这是要紧事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.63,0:33:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上11点半来找我  最好是要紧事\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 11:30 at night, it better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.63,0:33:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有个新的大逆转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here's a new twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.13,0:33:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这上面的叙述和常见传说相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}It repeats the conventional lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.49,0:34:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚马逊的战士与男子结合  男子被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazon warriors mate with males. The males are murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.81,0:34:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之类的  但是这上面说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yada, yada. But according to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.90,0:34:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人的不是女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not the women who do the killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.82,0:34:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为入门仪式的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, a ritual of initiation
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.69,0:34:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要求男女结合而生下的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}requires that the child born of the mating process
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.67,0:34:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须要杀掉她的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}must kill her own father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.35,0:34:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.49,0:34:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.02,0:34:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还很饿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And starving?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.17,0:34:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的花季很艰辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a tough sweet 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.08,0:34:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.80,0:34:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.19,0:34:35.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是真想找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really want help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.55,0:34:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.43,0:34:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,探员  这么晚还来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent. You're here late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.52,0:34:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是这样  我们能不能早上再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Listen, could we talk in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.89,0:34:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你急什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.37,0:34:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.04,0:34:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特  我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.86,0:34:58.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以以假扮联邦探员的罪名带你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could run you in for impersonating a federal agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.79,0:35:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们发现你失踪了会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, what happens when they find out you're missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.29,0:35:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们大概已经发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may have already found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.33,0:35:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they'll hunt me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.86,0:35:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道这肯定不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know this is gonna be hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.53,0:35:45.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我想逃出去  就必须现在逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if I'm gonna get out, I have to do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.22,0:35:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这儿有奶酪和剩下的玉米煎饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got cheese and a leftover burrito.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.16,0:35:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.19,0:35:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚问我相不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were asking if I believed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.95,0:36:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们说了拿下你会不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told you'd be a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.21,0:36:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就猜你会跟我闲扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you'd chat me up...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.92,0:36:16.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让我放松警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}try and catch me off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.21,0:36:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点就起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.15,0:36:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我等的是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was expecting your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.40,0:36:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事不是由她来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.21,0:36:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.02,0:36:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她们这么跟你说的吗  -这是我的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that what they told you? - It's what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.02,0:36:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我现在就该杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, I should just kill you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.47,0:36:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.58,0:36:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你三十秒前就能这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you could have done that 30 seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.24,0:36:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪的是不好下手  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weirdly hard, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.81,0:36:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我就有点于心不忍  -少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is for me. - Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.27,0:36:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能轻松呢  你是我爸爸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could it not be? You're my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.36,0:36:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们少来这套  -但确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! We're not gonna do that. - But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.19,0:36:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会走到这一步是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the reason that we're standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:36:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有你  也不会有我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be here if it weren't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.08,0:37:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们是你死我活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now someone has to kill someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.72,0:37:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.93,0:37:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止  我的童年真是不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, my childhood's been kind of disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.31,0:37:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没杀过人  艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't killed anybody yet, Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.63,0:37:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.28,0:37:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就放弃  我不会去追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now -- I won't go after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.24,0:37:20.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.06,0:37:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.35,0:37:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你别让他伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't let him hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.66,0:38:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大本营在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the mother ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.57,0:38:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去做个了结吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.10,0:38:27.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.05,0:38:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我也不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know what? I don't like it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.42,0:38:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一样  也很想折磨她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to torture them just as much as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.39,0:38:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.41,0:38:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次她们再出现  我们就有所准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}next time they surface, we'll be ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.38,0:38:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能活到那时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.52,0:39:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你就坐在那儿生闷气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine. Just sit there and be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.52,0:39:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前怎么跟我说的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.37,0:39:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我下不了手的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was the one who choked?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.84,0:39:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么说艾米的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say about Amy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.16,0:39:12.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"是怪就得杀"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You kill the monster!"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.92,0:39:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确要杀她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.83,0:39:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才不是呢  你当我二啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the hell you were! You think I'm an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.91,0:39:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当我二啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:18.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你本打算放跑她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you were gonna let her walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.34,0:39:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有  你别瞎说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wasn't. That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.97,0:39:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  她不是你的孩子  不是真正意义上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, she was not yours. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.62,0:39:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实她还真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, she, uh, she was, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.56,0:39:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过她还是个疯狂的杀男人的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just also happened to be a crazy man-killing monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.07,0:39:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.44,0:39:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  鲍比说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Bobby was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.37,0:39:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心没在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head's not in it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.65,0:39:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡死的时候  你就很难过了  现在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Cass died, you were wobbly, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.05,0:39:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.59,0:39:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就应对得很好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what, you're dealing with it so perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.52,0:39:46.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你个消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, news flash, pal --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.75,0:39:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我一样一团乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just as screwed up as I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.14,0:39:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不过...块头大点而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just...bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.75,0:39:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-啥  -不知道我说了啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.38,0:40:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.01,0:40:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  问题在于  今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the thing is, tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.94,0:40:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你险些丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}it almost got you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.17,0:40:08.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管你怎么应对这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't care how you deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.35,0:40:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really, really don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.19,0:40:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你别...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.62,0:40:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别挂掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.55,0:40:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力而为吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.43,0:40:23.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.81,0:40:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是我尽力而为  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means I'll do what I can. All right?
